# The Settings screen from the title screen, with no world to change. 640 by 480, scale 2. The pointer starts at 320, 240.

1 move 0 8                      # 320, 248: Settings
+1 screenshot title.png
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 screenshot screen.png
+1 move 0 -180                  # 320, 68: the first slider
+1 wheel 5
+1 move 100 288                 # 420, 356: Effects..., the right half of row 6
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 screenshot effects.png
+1 move -320 -288               # 100, 68: the first effect, block shapes
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 key escape down              # back a page
+1 key escape up
+1 move 220 384                 # 320, 452: Done
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 move 0 -204                  # 320, 248 again, so that the title is the same picture with the pointer where it was
+1 screenshot left.png          # the title again; or, if it could not be kept, still the screen with the reason on it
+1 move 0 204                   # 320, 452: Done, if the screen is still up, and nothing on the title
+1 button left down
+1 button left up
+1 move 0 -204                  # 320, 248
+1 screenshot left_again.png    # the screen has gone either way
+1 end
